  PATH                  adds Lean's and the workspace's library dirs (Windows)
  DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH     adds Lean's and the workspace's library dirs (MacOS)
  LD_LIBRARY_PATH       adds Lean's and the workspace's library dirs (other)

