+# Independent Stage 3–4 audit: HumanEval 27-flip-case
+
+## Scope and result
+
+I independently audited problem `27-flip-case`, condition `kit-semantics`,
+semantics mode `SUPPLIED_SEMANTICS`. Both `AUDIT_MODE` and the signed
